      "Generated index semantics change.",
      "Economy, telemetry, mission objective, or reward meaning changes."
    ],
    "migrationNotRequiredWhen": [
      "Documentation copy changes with no data contract change.",
      "Generated output is rebuilt without source changes.",
      "A browser smoke test or CI stability wrapper changes without canonical semantics."
